{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>For, etc.</b> Some say [he was] twenty years old, on account of the statement of Moses, \"from twenty years old\" (Exodus 30:14). If so, this prophecy [came] two years into the reign of Ahaz, and it is possible that he was less than twenty."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:37.661176474Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}